<<
/Title (Primary keys give every record an identity, foreign keys keep the nine tables consistent with one another, UNIQUE constraints stop duplicates and double bookings, CHECK constraints keep values inside their valid domains, DEFAULT values standardize new records, and NOT NULL ensures mandatory data is always present. The test script shows that valid data is accepted and invalid data is rejected by the database itself, so the integrity of the Airline Reservation System does not depend on any single application.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1263 0 R
>>
endobj
